@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = replace-with-jwt-token
@userId = 1

### All notification endpoints require a valid JWT.
### @userId must match an existing user in the database.

### Get all notifications for user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get unread notifications for user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/users/{{userId}}/non-lues
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mark one notification as read
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/1/lue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mark all notifications as read
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/users/{{userId}}/tous-lues
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
